],"id":"euler.lemma-5.8","kind":"claim","label":"Lemma 5.8","locator":"Lemma 5.8, Section 5","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Lemma 5.8.** The field $V$ is smooth, odd and divergence free, $\\Pi$ is smooth, and $$\\begin{equation}\n V_t+V\\cdot\\nabla V+\\nabla\\Pi=R_V,\\qquad\n R_V=R_P^\\natural+R_{\\widetilde\\chi}^\\natural . \\tag{5.46}\n\\end{equation}$$ The oscillation satisfies $$\\begin{equation}\n \\|W_{\\rm osc}^\\natural\\|_{C_tL^\\infty}\n \\le C_{0,P}\\mathsf D^b\\lambda^{-5/4}, \\tag{5.47}\n\\end{equation}$$ and for every $m\\ge0$, $$\\begin{equation}\n\\begin{gathered}\n \\|W_{\\rm osc}^\\natural\\|_{C_tC^{m,1/2}}\n \\le C_{m,P}\\mathsf D^{b(m+2)}\\lambda^{3(m+1)/2-5/4},\\qquad\n \\|\\bar W^\\natural\\|_{C_tC^{m,1/2}}\n \\le C_{m,P}\\mathsf D^{b(m+2)}\\lambda^{-5/2},\\\\\n \\|R_V\\|_{C_tC^{1,1/2}}\n \\le C_{\\rm step}\\lambda^2\n   \\bigl(\\lambda^{-2P/3}+\\|\\widetilde\\chi'\\gamma\\|_\\infty\\bigr),\n\\end{gathered} \\tag{5.48}\n\\end{equation}$$ where the last supremum is over $[t_0,T]$.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-5.8","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-5.8","id":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-5.8%22%2C%22euler.lemma-5.3%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-5.8%22%2C%22euler.lemma-5.3%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-5.3"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-5.8","id":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe